11. Test Gemini-enabled and fallback modes independently.
12. Test both local Express and Netlify function paths where applicable.
13. Record screenshots, API responses, logs and execution results.
14. Identify the exact file and function responsible for every defect.
15. Fix defects only after documenting their original behavior.
16. Rerun affected tests after every fix.
17. Run regression tests after corrections.
18. Update README and technical documentation when they do not match the actual implementation.
19. Never fabricate test results, performance numbers, accuracy figures or test coverage.
